Bundled under assets/bpc/:
- site_rules.json — domains and per-site rules extracted from sites.js,
  custom/sites_custom.json, sites_updated.json, and host_permissions
- cs/contentScript.js, cs/purify.min.js, cs_local/*.js — the extension's
  content scripts, run inside QuaX's WebView through a chrome.runtime shim
  (assets/bpc/cs/runtime_shim.js) that delivers bg2csData and answers
  getExtSrc / getExtFetch / clear_cookies / refreshCurrentTab from Dart
- unhide.js — extra generic overlay removal as a second pass

The extension's declarativeNetRequest rules are reimplemented with
shouldInterceptRequest. Header and cookie changes are applied by the
Flutter reader before the page loads.
